# Realistic prompt text that must produce ZERO shield markers.
#
# This file is the precision denominator. Six rounds of regex patching each
# widened a pattern to catch a true positive and silently created a new false
# positive, because nothing measured the collateral. Every line here was an
# actual observed false positive, or is one line away from one.
#
# Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
# A line that produces ANY marker fails the build.

